{"t":"NNE","made":"2026-11-17 08:51","name":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc.","ko":"나노뉴클리어","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","employees":36,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://nanonuclearenergy.com","summary_en":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc. operates as a nuclear energy company. The company is developing KRONOS MMR Energy System, a high-temperature gas-cooled reactor; LOKI MMR, a compact microreactor designed for remote and specialized applications; ZEUS, a solid core battery reactor; and ODIN, a low-pressure salt coolant reactor. It is also developing a high-assay low-enriched uranium fuel processing facility to provide a fuel pipeline for the nuclear reactor industry, and fuel transportation and nuclear consultation businesses. The company was incorporated in 2022 and is based in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"나노원자력에너지주식회사(NANO Nuclear Energy Inc.)는 원자력 에너지 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 고온 가스 냉각식 원자로인 KRONOS MMR 에너지 시스템을 개발하고 있습니다. 원격 및 특수 애플리케이션용으로 설계된 소형 마이크로리액터인 LOKI MMR; 솔리드 코어 배터리 리액터인 ZEUS; 저압 염냉각 원자로인 ODIN이 있습니다. 또한 원자로 산업, 연료 운송 및 원자력 자문 사업을 위한 연료 파이프라인을 제공하기 위해 고분석 저농축 우라늄 연료 처리 시설을 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2022년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":10.74,"mcap":576718080.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-10.6600485,"peg":null,"ps":2694.4155,"pb":0.93619245,"ev_ebitda":-0.345,"div":0.0,"beta":5.647,"hi52":39.87,"lo52":9.291},"fin":{"rev":214042.0,"rev_g":null,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.29065,"op":-245.4537,"net":0.0,"roe":-0.080369994,"fcf":-35458040.0,"cash":581638848.0,"debt":2837808.0,"de":0.461,"eps":-0.69,"feps":-1.0075},"own":{"short":0.38759997,"inst":0.44761002,"insider":0.18546},"analyst":{"n":8,"mean":34.75,"median":39.0,"high":50.0,"low":18.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.55556,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":6,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":2,"sell":0,"str